@host = http://localhost:5069

### Listele
GET {{host}}/api/students

### Ekle
POST {{host}}/api/students
Content-Type: application/json

{ "firstName": "Ayşe", "lastName": "Yılmaz", "email": "ayse@example.com", "gradeLevel": 7 }

### Tek kayıt
GET {{host}}/api/students/1

### Güncelle
PUT {{host}}/api/students/1
Content-Type: application/json

{ "firstName": "Ayşe", "lastName": "Demir", "email": "ayse@example.com", "gradeLevel": 8 }

### Geçersiz istek (400 beklenir)
POST {{host}}/api/students
Content-Type: application/json

{ "firstName": "", "lastName": "X", "gradeLevel": 99 }

### Sil
DELETE {{host}}/api/students/1
